# Docker's build context is the repo root, and it is sent to Docker before anything is copied. This
# list starts from "nothing" and allows back only what apps/server/Dockerfile copies, so .env,
# knowledge/, profile/ and node_modules can't end up in the image or in the build cache.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/server/package.json
!apps/server/src
!packages/shared/package.json
!packages/shared/src
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
